Pharmacokinetic parameters were analyzed with a two-compartment elimination model. AUCinf (area under the curve to infinity) was calculated using the log-linear trapezoidal method20. Terminal half-life (T1/2) was calculated using two-phase clearance models. Log-linear regression of the concentration data including at least the last six sampling time-points with measurable concentrations. Serum clearance was estimated as2\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
